      <div class="mis-cifra"><b>60+</b><span>Organizations and SMEs supported</span></div>
      <div class="mis-cifra"><b>13</b><span>Years building installed capacity</span></div>
      <div class="mis-cifra"><b>400+</b><span>Data layers in the Nosara digital twin</span></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="mis-blq"><div class="mis-env">
      <div class="mis-kick">What I do</div>
      <h2 class="mis-tit">Four practices with the same lens</h2>
      <p class="mis-baja">Feedback loops, leverage points and emergent dynamics: complex systems thinking is what shapes how I design tools, read evidence and frame decisions.</p>
      <div class="mis-rej">
        <div class="mis-nodo"><i class="mis-pt"></i><span class="mis-et">01 &middot; Territory</span><h3>Territorial intelligence</h3><p>Census, cadastre, digital twin and geospatial planning to see the district as it actually is.</p><div class="mis-barras"><i></i><i></i></div></div>
        <div class="mis-nodo"><i class="mis-pt"></i><span class="mis-et">02 &middot; Fiscal</span><h3>Subnational public finance</h3><p>Fiscal balances, gap quantification and financial sustainability for local governments and organizations.</p><div class="mis-barras"><i></i><i></i></div></div>
        <div class="mis-nodo"><i class="mis-pt"></i><span class="mis-et">03 &middot; Data</span><h3>Data science and evaluation</h3><p>Applied research, results measurement and impact evaluation with methods that survive scrutiny.</p><div class="mis-barras"><i></i><i></i></div></div>
        <div class="mis-nodo"><i class="mis-pt mis-esp"></i><span class="mis-et">04 &middot; Applied AI</span><h3>AI for collective good</h3><p>Applied AI for social good, data sovereignty and education. The chapter I am writing now.</p><div class="mis-barras"><i></i><i></i></div></div>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="mis-blq mis-panel"><div class="mis-env">
      <div class="mis-kick">Selected work</div>
      <h2 class="mis-tit">Four things done for the first time</h2>
      <div class="mis-obras">
        <a class="mis-obra" href="https://myintelligentsystem.com" target="_blank"><span class="mis-anio">2026 &mdash; now</span><div><h3>My Intelligent System</h3><p>I install intelligent systems, automation and applied AI for businesses, organizations and institutions. Closed price per stage, no monthly fee.</p><div class="mis-datos"><span>Installed systems, not hours</span><span>Proprietary kernel + APIs</span><span>No monthly fee</span></div></div><span class="mis-flecha">&#8599;</span></a>
        <a class="mis-obra" href="https://desarrollocomunitario.org/gemelodigital" target="_blank"><span class="mis-anio">2026</span><div><h3>Nosara 3D Digital Twin</h3><p>The first digital twin of a territory in Central America: a three-dimensional replica built on measured relief and high-resolution satellite imagery, which can be toured, queried and used to simulate scenarios.</p><div class="mis-datos"><span>400+ data layers</span><span>Cartography from 1944</span><span>Climate projections to 2100</span></div></div><span class="mis-flecha">&#8599;</span></a>
        <a class="mis-obra" href="/proyectos"><span class="mis-anio">2024</span><div><h3>Nosara Community Census</h3><p>Coordination of the first district-level census in Costa Rica, with technical advisory from INEC.</p><div class="mis-datos"><span>USD 120,000 raised</span><span>USD 50,000 in kind</span><span>95.1% coverage</span></div></div><span class="mis-flecha">&#8599;</span></a>
        <a class="mis-obra" href="/proyectos"><span class="mis-anio">2026</span><div><h3>Nosara Territorial Fiscal Balance</h3><p>The first district-level fiscal study in the country: what the territory produces, what it receives back, and the distance between the two.</p><div class="mis-datos"><span>Gap above USD 55M/yr</span><span>Cadastral factor 12.1x</span><span>96.6% informal lodging</span></div></div><span class="mis-flecha">&#8599;</span></a>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem;"><a href="/proyectos" class="mis-btn mis-fantasma">See all projects</a></p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="mis-blq"><div class="mis-env">
      <div class="mis-kick">Learning out loud</div>
      <h2 class="mis-tit">What I publish, and what I am still thinking through</h2>
      <div class="mis-rej">
        <a class="mis-nodo" href="/publicaciones"><i class="mis-pt"></i><span class="mis-et">Publications</span><h3>Studies and reports</h3><p>Fiscal balance, census methodology and applied research, open for anyone to check.</p><div class="mis-barras"><i></i><i></i></div></a>
        <a class="mis-nodo" href="/blog"><i class="mis-pt mis-esp"></i><span class="mis-et">Blog</span><h3>Notes in progress</h3><p>Teaching as I go: systems thinking, territorial data and the questions I have not resolved yet.</p><div class="mis-barras"><i></i><i></i></div></a>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="mis-cierre"><div class="mis-env">
      <div class="mis-kick">Working together</div>
      <h2>If your territory or your organization needs to be read as a system</h2>
      <p>I work in Spanish and English, with communities, universities, international cooperation, foundations and private philanthropy.</p>
      <div class="mis-acciones">
        <a class="mis-btn" href="/contacto">Start a conversation</a>
        <a class="mis-txt" href="https://linkedin.com/in/emmanuelgpcr" target="_blank">LinkedIn &#8599;</a>
        <a class="mis-txt" href="/files/emmanuel-gutierrez.vcf" download>Save contact card</a>
      </div>
    </div></section>
